
# CleanTalk

> CleanTalk is a website cloud platform providing Anti-spam, Security, malware scanning, IP/email reputation checks, blocklist data, and uptime monitoring for web sites.

CleanTalk helps website owners protect forms, comments, registrations, orders, logins, and other user-generated content from spam and abuse without CAPTCHA or visitor puzzles.

## Main products

- Cloud Anti-Spam for websites and eCommerce
- Anti-Spam API for apps and custom integrations
- WordPress Security plugin
- Website Malware Scanner
- Malware Removal Service
- IP Blacklist and Reputation Checker
- Email reputation and disposable email checking
- Uptime Monitoring
- Blocklist API and offline blocklist database

